---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Join Our Team">
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-4 text-center">
      <h1 class="font-display font-light text-4xl sm:text-5xl">
        <span class="text-brand-blue">Join</span> <span class="text-brand-gold">Our Team</span>
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-4 pb-20 space-y-5 text-center text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Catalyst is always looking for highly motivated individuals with a strong interest in energy access and climate change mitigation to join our team and support delivery of several mandates. Our team is fully decentralized and works remotely in Africa, Europe and the US.
      </p>
      <p class="italic">
        Catalyst's DNA is practitioners. As such, we are interested in working with people with prior experience in energy access enterprises (PAYGo solar, mini-grids, C+I solar, clean cooking). We are also interested in individuals with a background in management/strategy consulting in energy access or a related field. If this sounds like you, then get in touch by sending your cv and a short email cover letter to:
        <a href="mailto:jobs@catalyst-advisors.com" class="text-brand-gold hover:underline not-italic">jobs@catalyst-advisors.com</a>
      </p>
      <p class="italic text-sm">
        Catalyst values a diverse team and strives to increase the diversity of thought, perspectives, ideas and experience in the team. As such, we are committed to equal opportunities for all. All candidates will be considered without attention to age, race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran, or disability status.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
